# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Credentials / secrets — these must NEVER be committed
.env
.env.*
service_account.json
config.py

# Temporary files
~$*
*.tmp

# Runtime lock file only — NOT the whole state/ folder. sync_state.json
# inside state/ must be committed; it's what makes daily syncs incremental
# instead of re-pulling your entire Sheet history from scratch every run.
state/run_daily.lock

# Backup/archive clutter
AUTOBOTAIMLGIT.zip

# NOTE: logs/, data/*.parquet, data/*.json, and README.md are
# intentionally NOT listed here. All of these need to be committed:
#   - logs/run_daily.log: needed for G1's reliability tracking to
#     accumulate real history across runs
#   - data/*.parquet: your actual accumulated option chain data
#   - data/model_results_*.json: Phase 2's real output, what the
#     dashboard's KPI scorecard reads
#   - README.md: your project documentation, should always be tracked
